        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "弓道において、的中させる欲を捨てて無心になることは難しい。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "雑念を払い、無心の状態で瞑想にふける。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "彼は無心で木像を彫り続け、気づけば外が明るくなっていた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "gloss": "insentient",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "無心の石や草木にも、仏性が宿っているという教えがある。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "科学的な視点で見れば、植物は無心の存在として扱われることが多い。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "無心の自然界に対して、人間はあまりに多くの意味を求めすぎる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 4,
        "gloss": "pestering (someone for money, etc.)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "「悪いけど、また少しだけ金を無心させてくれないか？」",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "彼は働こうともせず、老いた両親に小遣いを無心し続けている。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "昔の教え子から、寄付を無心する手紙が突然届いた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      }
